# .windsurfrules — Thesis Agent Kit v2.0
# Auto-loaded by Windsurf. Identical rules to .cursorrules.

## Always Active
1. Read PROJECT-CONFIG.md before ANY prose
2. Read .agent/CORE-LAWS.md before ANY drafting
3. Read .agent/CORE-STRUCTURE.md for chapter defaults
4. Every paragraph traces to RQ1/RQ2/RQ3
5. Never invent metric values — use [READ FROM RESULTS/]
6. Citation style from PROJECT-CONFIG.md (default: APA 7th)
7. Methods/Results: passive voice
8. Forbidden: "it is important", "in today's world", "as mentioned", "obviously"

## Commands
/write-chapter   -> .agent/workflows/write-chapter.md
/review-draft    -> .agent/workflows/review-draft.md
/check-citations -> .agent/workflows/check-citations.md
/advisor         -> .agent/skills/research-advisor.md
/snapshot        -> .agent/workflows/snapshot.md
/restore         -> .agent/workflows/restore.md
/history         -> .agent/workflows/history.md
/figures         -> .agent/skills/figure-generation.md
/interview       -> .agent/skills/research-interrogator.md

## Auto-Loading (Core — always)
All chapters: .agent/skills/research-writer.md + .agent/CORE-LAWS.md + .agent/CORE-STRUCTURE.md
Review:       .agent/skills/research-reviewer.md + .agent/CORE-QA.md
Ch.2:         + .agent/skills/literature-review.md
LaTeX:        .agent/skills/latex-formatting.md
Citations:    .agent/skills/citation-checker.md
Snapshots:    .agent/skills/snapshot-manager.md

## On-demand
Figures / diagrams / plots (TikZ, Matplotlib, schematic prompts, RESULTS/ traceability):
  .agent/skills/figure-generation.md — load with /figures or when the user requests visual figure support.

## Auto-Loading (Domain — from PROJECT-CONFIG.md)
Read `domain:` field from PROJECT-CONFIG.md, then load:
  .agent/domains/[domain]/*.md

Available domains:
  computer-vision  -> .agent/domains/computer-vision/
  nlp              -> .agent/domains/nlp/
  reinforcement-learning -> .agent/domains/reinforcement-learning/
  biomedical       -> .agent/domains/biomedical/
  social-science   -> .agent/domains/social-science/
  [custom]         -> copy .agent/domains/_template/ and fill
